WEBVTT

00:04:26.905 --> 00:04:30.444
Lai drusku pamainītu, 
šoreiz paņemsim ceturto rindu,

00:04:30.468 --> 00:04:32.122
teiksim, viens, divi, trīs, četri.

00:04:32.146 --> 00:04:35.320
Ja katrs no jums nosauktu 
ciparu no nulles līdz deviņi,

00:04:35.344 --> 00:04:37.834
tas būs četrciparu skaitlis, 
ko kāpināšu kvadrātā.

00:04:38.222 --> 00:04:39.587
Deviņi.

00:04:39.611 --> 00:04:40.682
Septiņi.

00:04:40.706 --> 00:04:42.151
Pieci.

00:04:42.175 --> 00:04:43.214
Astoņi.

00:04:43.238 --> 00:04:46.332
9758, tas man aizņems nedaudz laika, 
tāpēc esiet pacietīgi.

00:04:46.356 --> 00:04:48.563
95 miljoni...

00:04:49.007 --> 00:04:50.824
(Nopūšas)

00:04:52.467 --> 00:04:55.720
218 564?

00:04:55.744 --> 00:04:56.769
Brīvprātīgā: Jā!

00:04:56.793 --> 00:04:58.031
A.B.: Liels paldies.

00:04:58.055 --> 00:05:01.085
(Aplausi)